{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "0CL9", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$2$", "MATH_0002": "$2$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:30a9c1d9b4fa53bcc0a2a072b21e1b9b010a3af0ebe92482f9e839ef237579b5", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:b1fb07c0a8d39bd9da3078651861b07b21b5d45bc5104ff6dbf88821b96cca20", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nWe need to be careful when stating the valuative criterion. Namely, in\nthe formulation we need to speak about commutative diagrams but we are\nworking in a <MATH_0001>-category and we need to make sure the <MATH_0002>-morphisms\ncompose correctly as well!\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:345560cb33e9f8c849fa85ffbf573c769a0a67768fcec9ac11b0695952849a3e", "unit_id": "tag:0CL9:prose-0001"}
